<p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">정보통신기술진흥센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">(IITP)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">에서 주관하는 </span></font><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">IT</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">인력양성사업</span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">으로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">IITP</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">와 금오공과대학교가 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">SW</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">중소기업들과 컨소시엄을 구성하여 실무능력을 갖춘 맞춤형 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">SW </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">인력을 양성한다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">석사과정생들은 입학과 동시에 </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">기업과 고용계약</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">을 </font><font color=\"#000000\">맺게 되며</font></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">,</font> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">등록금 전액 지원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">학업 장려금 지급</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">해외 연수 등을 지원</span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">받고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">졸업일로부터 </span></font><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2.5</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">년간 협약업체에 채용</span><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">되어 근무하게 된다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">.</span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 2pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">◆ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">모집학과 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">컴퓨터공학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">컴퓨터소프트웨어공학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-f